{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16547","headline":"宴柏台 · 陈翊","name":"宴柏台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华台陈桂席，密榭宴清真。\n柏叶犹霜气，桃花似汉津。\n青尊照深夕，绿绮映芳春。\n欲忆相逢後，无言岭海人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈翊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}